meta {
  name: List Jobs
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/schema/{{connectionId}}/jobs
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Scheduled jobs that run against this connection's database — SQL Server Agent jobs (from msdb) or pg_cron jobs: { available, reason?, jobs: [{ id, name, engine, enabled, description?, category?, schedule?, lastRun?, nextRunAt?, stepCount }] }. Agent jobs are listed only when a step targets this database. Dates are the server's local time.

  `available: false` with a `reason` when the connection's login lacks the grant (SQLAgentReaderRole in msdb; USAGE + SELECT on the cron schema); `available: false` with no reason when pg_cron is not installed.

  Requires a valid Bearer JWT ({{token}}) plus **read** capability for the connection's environment — 403 otherwise.

  Errors: 503 { error, code: "CONNECTION_FAILED" }; 500 { error }.
}
